WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.147
Zippy drove toward the tree.

2
00:00:10.148 --> 00:00:14.398
He slammed on his brakes.

3
00:00:14.399 --> 00:00:17.042
But the racetrack was slippery.

4
00:00:17.043 --> 00:00:20.141
Zippy slid.

5
00:00:20.142 --> 00:00:23.211
He tried to turn.

6
00:00:23.212 --> 00:00:27.715
"Oh no!" cried Zippy.

7
00:00:27.716 --> 00:00:32.970
"I'm going to hit the—" Bam!

8
00:00:32.971 --> 00:00:43.063
Zippy's side banged into the tree.

9
00:00:43.064 --> 00:00:46.060
"Ouch!" said Zippy.

10
00:00:46.061 --> 00:00:49.050
"I got a bad dent."

11
00:00:49.051 --> 00:00:52.466
Eddy drove slowly.

12
00:00:52.467 --> 00:01:08.881
He went around the tree.

13
00:01:08.882 --> 00:01:12.385
He went past Zippy.

14
00:01:12.386 --> 00:01:15.811
"You were going too fast," said Eddy.

15
00:01:15.812 --> 00:01:21.833
Zippy frowned.

16
00:01:21.834 --> 00:01:25.978
Zoom! Zippy shot past Eddy.

17
00:01:25.979 --> 00:01:31.795
Water splashed on Eddy.

18
00:01:31.796 --> 00:01:36.376
Then Zippy hit a big puddle.

19
00:01:36.377 --> 00:01:39.173
He went left.

20
00:01:39.174 --> 00:01:41.879
He went right.

21
00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:44.812
Zippy spun in circles.

22
00:01:44.813 --> 00:01:48.087
"Whoa!" he cried.

23
00:01:48.088 --> 00:01:51.018
"Oh no!" said Eddy.

24
00:01:51.019 --> 00:01:53.887
He saw Zippy spin.

25
00:01:53.888 --> 00:02:04.791
Then Zippy flew off the track!

